Feature: E2E combine

  Scenario Outline: combine one client with one orgAdmin of the same homeserver
    When I connect <client> to <admin>
    Then it works

    @Filter(client.hasTag("client"))
    @Filter(admin.hasTag("orgAdmin"))
    @Filter(client.properties["homeserver"].equals(admin.properties["homeserver"]))
    Examples:
      | client | admin |
